        "TileImage": "$($repository 07c64264-9fa9-4c4a-a933-802011bee9e6).Image",
        "Description": "Recently, Agent 47 found that the beautiful city of Sapienza was taken over by malevolent forces. He believes that behind this evil scheme is a powerful occultist whose flight logs show a recent visit to Sapienza. As Agent 47 is a very thorough assassin, he has also planned to eliminate a horror movie actor that he believes is corrupting the minds of the people in Sapienza. And also a stoner...? Anyways, help Agent 47 cleanse this Italian land and its Italian residents once and for all.",
